      "id": "evaluate-from-inside",
      "title": "Evaluate from the inside outward",
      "explanation": "Evaluate the innermost denominator first, then work outward. The successive values are\n\\[\n3+\\frac13=\\frac{10}{3},\n\\]\n\\[\n3+\\frac{1}{10/3}=3+\\frac3{10}=\\frac{33}{10}.\n\\]\nTherefore the full expression equals\n\\[\n3+\\frac{1}{33/10}=3+\\frac{10}{33}\n=\\boxed{\\frac{109}{33}},\n\\]\nwhich is choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
